    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6245b762b1db81f63f7b418",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "希望有朝一日，能请您抽时间\n与我好好聊一聊！\n所以就先送份礼物，作为相识的契机。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf63ad24f1e812d74c16765e080dadbe0a8509ed5fb54e04d2d1c96dbdfd592e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111107.json",
