    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90ee03998beb48e4f917d4d2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……听她这么一说，重新审视自己的身份，\n我的确已经是『带领赛马娘在三后冠赛场上\n大放异彩的训练员』了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a091cf8788564de1f53f65db347c65604996cd846a2133676d0070b7cecc5c8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
