      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "短短几年前我还只是个彻头彻尾的新人。\n而且自认，自己在新人中也不过是除了认真以外\n毫无长处的朴素类型――",
      "source_fingerprint": "cced903940b4c6d04c1fd2edbb2c6dd0f2da1e6fdd732e70afafe160fa3300e6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
